Requirement Analysis Phase
In this phase, the requirements of the FitBuddy application were identified.
The system requires basic information from the user such as name, user ID, age and weight.
The user can select their fitness goal, such as weight loss, muscle gain or general wellness.
The user can also select their fitness level, such as beginner, intermediate or advanced.
The user can select the required workout intensity as low, medium or high.
The user provides the amount of time available for exercise.
After collecting these details, the system sends the information to the Gemini AI model.
Gemini generates a personalized 7-day workout plan with daily activities, warm-up, exercises, sets or duration, rest, cool-down and notes.
The system also generates general nutrition, hydration and recovery tips.
The user can submit feedback about the generated plan. The system uses this feedback to generate an updated workout plan.
The application also requires a database to store user information, fitness plans, feedback and updated plans.
